#created by Duel Circuit - Trishula Trish (Plant Synchro, 2011)
#era 2011
#tier Alley headliner (docs/dev/HEADLINERS-2026-11-01.md)
#about Foolish Burial sends Dandylion for two Fluff Tokens, Debris Dragon brings it back, and four monsters make nine: Trishula banishes a card from your hand, your field and your Graveyard. Glow-Up Bulb and Spore come back for whatever Levels are left.
#why Trishula, Dandylion and Glow-Up Bulb are Forbidden today (Spore and Debris Dragon long limited); in March 2011 Trishula, Glow-Up Bulb and Spore were all legal at three.
#source Built from Format Library deck 4211 (decks/history/plant-synchro.ydk, YCSPROV11): three Glow-Up Bulb, three Spore, Fishborg Blaster and Tour Guide for the Monarchs, Ryko and some backrow, so nine comes together more often
#banlist TCG March 2011
